WEBVTT

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.821
GRINDELWALD: Mr. Scamander.

00:00:12.905 --> 00:00:17.075
Do you think Dumbledore
will mourn for you?

00:00:27.336 --> 00:00:29.504
LETA: Grindelwald! Stop!

00:00:37.054 --> 00:00:38.054
Leta...

00:00:42.518 --> 00:00:44.060
(GRUNTING)

00:00:48.816 --> 00:00:51.109
GRINDELWALD:
This one I believe I know.

00:00:52.069 --> 00:00:53.820
Leta Lestrange.

00:00:54.989 --> 00:01:00.452
Despised entirely amongst wizards,
unloved, mistreated,

00:01:02.037 --> 00:01:06.124
yet brave, so very brave.

00:01:11.255 --> 00:01:12.881
Time to come home.

00:01:31.025 --> 00:01:32.275
I love you.

00:01:41.535 --> 00:01:42.619
Go!

00:01:43.621 --> 00:01:44.621
Go!

00:01:45.414 --> 00:01:46.581
(GRUNTING)

00:01:55.716 --> 00:01:57.842
- (GASPS)
- (STRUGGLING)

00:02:08.437 --> 00:02:10.104
I hate Paris.

00:02:16.862 --> 00:02:18.112
(YELPS)

00:02:22.451 --> 00:02:23.618
(ROARING)

00:02:40.052 --> 00:02:41.177
(NEWT SHOUTS)

00:02:44.181 --> 00:02:45.515
(WIZARDS YELLING)

00:02:49.979 --> 00:02:51.062
Together, in a circle.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.647
Your wand into the earth.

00:02:53.816 --> 00:02:56.025
Or all Paris will be destroyed.

00:02:59.113 --> 00:03:00.530
(ROARING)

00:03:02.992 --> 00:03:04.492
<i>BOTH: Finite!</i>

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.370
<i>Finite!</i>

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:08.830
<i>Finite!</i>

00:03:10.249 --> 00:03:11.249
<i>Finite!</i>

00:03:21.385 --> 00:03:22.844
(ROARING)

00:03:33.939 --> 00:03:35.607
(SCREECHING)

00:04:07.556 --> 00:04:09.098
(YELLING)

00:04:25.157 --> 00:04:26.532
(ALL PANTING)

00:04:39.046 --> 00:04:40.213
(JACOB CRYING)

00:04:47.012 --> 00:04:48.346
(SNIFFLES)

00:05:13.706 --> 00:05:15.623
(THESEUS CRYING)

00:05:21.005 --> 00:05:22.839
I've chosen my side.

00:05:38.522 --> 00:05:39.772
(NIFFLER CHITTERS)

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.400
Oh.

00:05:44.069 --> 00:05:45.445
Come here.

00:05:45.946 --> 00:05:48.448
I've got you. I've got you.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.787
(NIFFLER SNIFFING)

